      {
        "answer": "Yes, it triggers and activates.",
        "question": "Does this card's 1st [All Turns] effect trigger when this card itself is played?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "\"When [...] would leave the battle area other than by battle\" refers to when this Digimon is placed in the trash other than as a result of a battle, returned to the hand/deck, placed in the security stack, moved to the breeding area, or placed under another card.",
        "question": "What does this card's \"when [...] would leave the battle area other than by [...] a battle\" mean, exactly?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.  This Digimon hasn't yet been sent to the trash because this effect activates when this Digimon would leave the battle area, so you can't choose it from the trash as the card to place as the bottom digivolution card.",
